<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective Jan 23-29:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 56.00</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 59.64</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 61.32</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 64.40</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$156.82</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$117.62</p>
<p>    Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 82.97</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 19.34</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  1.93</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 21.58</p>
</text>
